        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, lignite, at cogen, allocation exergy
The average allocated fuel input per heat output is about 1.04 MJ/MJ. The heat supply of this technology in the region is at about 2300 TJ based on Eurostat/IEA. NA; UUID: f029267f-aad4-3a61-8805-40502adbd912
Heat output at the plant gate. The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in the region adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content). 
Location: GR in 2019
Technology: Average installed technology.
Time period: 
Production volume: 2300 TJ
Sampling: Databases/ literature data based on regional statistics.
Extrapolations: No relevant extrapolations.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f029267f-aad4-3a61-8805-40502adbd912.xml</text>
